Homepage: https://github.com/rkivalin/certforge

Package: certforge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ACME certificate manager with DANE and systemd integration
 Certforge automates ACME certificate issuance and renewal: DNS-01
 challenges through RFC 2136 dynamic updates, HTTP-01 and TLS-ALPN-01 for
 IP address certificates, DANE TLSA record publication, secrets from
 systemd credentials, and post-renewal hooks that reload or restart
 services over D-Bus. A daily timer drives the oneshot renew service.
